  "body": "The regex validation which is provided here:\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#valid-e-mail-address\nis wrong for some reasons and matches when:\n- there is no tld provided (example: asdf@a )\n- character . (dot, period, full stop), provided that it is not the first or last character, and provided also that it does not appear consecutively (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Email_address#Local_part) (example: .a..@a)\n",
